Patch: compileFormat
Letter: F
Requires: none
Files: src/datetime.js, src/impl/formatter.js, src/impl/util.js
Summary: fast paths along the route a numeric token takes, and the Formatter compiling formats once, reading shifted Duration fields directly, and memoizing the name each DateTime token resolves to
